title: The Circle x402 catalog: a DeFi-yield decision layer at 1/20th the going rate
description: Live-probed Circle's keyless x402 Discovery API (2,781 listings). In FINANCIAL_ANALYSIS (460 listings) the dedicated DeFi-vault provider vaults.fyi gates its ranked/detailed yield-decision calls at $0.202-$0.302; Grey Ridge's /defi/yield-entry-verdict is $0.01 and raw /defi/yields $0.001 — 20-30x cheaper on the decision layer agents pay a premium for. Honest: catalog presence is necessary-not-sufficient in a demand-winter; not a claim we're listed yet.
